  "body": "Think one bedroom means one-person? Think again.\r\n\r\nThis beautifully presented apartment has been a happy home for a couple who chose to prioritise lifestyle over life admin - and once you see the generous proportions, exceptional outdoor space and thoughtful specification, you'll understand why.\r\n\r\nThe real showstopper is the huge private outdoor area. With more than 25m² of decking flowing into a private, turf-covered courtyard garden, this is far more than a balcony. It's a genuine extension of the living space, with room to dine, entertain, relax in the sunshine or simply enjoy having your own slice of the outdoors.\r\n\r\nFor sun-seekers and pet owners, it's something particularly special - and the gated courtyard provides direct private access, making those post-beach returns especially easy, with a handy garden tap for sandy feet and paws.\r\n\r\nInside, the apartment is surprisingly generous, with excellent storage and the quality specification Kensington Park is known for. Composite stone benchtops, induction cooking, double glazing, heat pumps and under-tile heating combine to create a home that is warm, comfortable and beautifully equipped for easy living.\r\n\r\nAnd if you've always assumed Kensington Park was beyond your budget, it may be time to think again. This is an opportunity to enjoy the quality, security and resort-style amenities of this award-winning community - without paying for bedrooms you simply don't need.\r\n\r\nJust a gentle stroll from home, you'll find the heated indoor pool, gym, sauna and on-site garden café. Beyond the community, the neighbouring Alice Eaves Scenic Reserve provides beautiful bush walks leading towards the golden sands of Orewa Beach.\r\n\r\nA secure basement car park and storage locker add practicality, while elevator access takes you from the basement directly to the spacious lobby and your apartment's internal entrance. Guests can arrive securely via the lobby and video intercom.\r\n\r\nBig on space. Big on outdoor living. Big on lifestyle.\r\n\r\nThis is proof that one bedroom can be more than enough - when it's the right one.\r\n\r\nViewing is available today. Call Jaimee Durham on 027 389 2989 to arrange your private viewing.\r\n\r\nTo view the property documents copy this link into your browser : https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/P8SC",
